- **`replacements`**: Direct lookup dictionary mapping both int and string versions of `0`/`1` → `'5+'`
- **`apply`**: A lambda function for inline use — converts any input team size of `'0'` or `'1'` to `'5+'`, otherwise returns the value unchanged
